{"surah": 81, "verses": [{"ayah": 1, "text": "إِذَا ٱلشَّمْسُ كُوِّرَتْ ", "translation": "When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلشَّمْسُ", "translit": "ُsْmَّhslٱ", "root": "شمس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُوِّرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِّwُk", "root": "كور"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 2, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ ٱنكَدَرَتْ ", "translation": "And when the stars fall, dispersing,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلنُّجُومُ", "translit": "ُmwُjgُّnlٱ", "root": "نجم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱنكَدَرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrَdَknٱ", "root": "كدر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 3, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتْ ", "translation": "And when the mountains are removed", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجِبَالُ", "translit": "ُlāَbِjgْlٱ", "root": "جبل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سُيِّرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِّyُs", "root": "سير"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 4, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتْ ", "translation": "And when full-term she-camels[1] are neglected", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْعِشَارُ", "translit": "ُrāَhsِʿعْlٱ", "root": "عشر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عُطِّلَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlِّṭُʿع", "root": "عطل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 5, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتْ ", "translation": "And when the wild beasts are gathered", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْوُحُوشُ", "translit": "ُhswُḥُwْlٱ", "root": "وحش"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حُشِرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِhsُḥ", "root": "حشر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 6, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتْ ", "translation": "And when the seas are filled with flame[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْبِحَارُ", "translit": "ُrāَḥِbْlٱ", "root": "بحر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سُجِّرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِّjgُs", "root": "سجر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 7, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ ", "translation": "And when the souls are paired[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلنُّفُوسُ", "translit": "ُswُfُّnlٱ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "زُوِّجَتْ", "translit": "ْtَjgِّwُz", "root": "زوج"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 8, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتْ ", "translation": "And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَdۥُءْwَmْlٱ", "root": "واد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سُئِلَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlِyʾُs", "root": "سال"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 9, "text": "بِأَىِّ ذَنۢبٍ قُتِلَتْ ", "translation": "For what sin she was killed", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "بِأَىِّ", "translit": "ِّàَaʾِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ذَنۢبٍ", "translit": "ٍbۢnَhd", "root": "ذنب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "قُتِلَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlِtُq", "root": "قتل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 10, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ ", "translation": "And when the pages[1] are spread [i.e., made public]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلصُّحُفُ", "translit": "ُfُḥُّṣlٱ", "root": "صحف"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نُشِرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِhsُn", "root": "نشر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 11, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ ", "translation": "And when the sky is stripped away", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُشِطَتْ", "translit": "ْtَṭِhsُk", "root": "كشط"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 12, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ ", "translation": "And when Hellfire is set ablaze", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجَحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَjgْlٱ", "root": "جحم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سُعِّرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrِّʿعُs", "root": "سعر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 13, "text": "وَإِذَا ٱلْجَنَّةُ أُزْلِفَتْ ", "translation": "And when Paradise is brought near,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجَنَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّnَjgْlٱ", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُزْلِفَتْ", "translit": "ْtَfِlْzُaʾ", "root": "زلف"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 14, "text": "عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّآ أَحْضَرَتْ ", "translation": "A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it].[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "عَلِمَتْ", "translit": "ْtَmِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَفْسٌ", "translit": "ٌsْfَn", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَحْضَرَتْ", "translit": "ْtَrَḍْḥَaʾ", "root": "حضر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 15, "text": "فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلْخُنَّسِ ", "translation": "So I swear by the retreating stars -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَآ", "translit": "ٓāَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أُقْسِمُ", "translit": "ُmِsْqُaʾ", "root": "قسم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِٱلْخُنَّسِ", "translit": "ِsَّnُhkْlٱِb", "root": "خنس"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 16, "text": "ٱلْجَوَارِ ٱلْكُنَّسِ ", "translation": "Those that run [their courses] and disappear [i.e., set]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلْجَوَارِ", "translit": "ِrāَwَjgْlٱ", "root": "جري"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكُنَّسِ", "translit": "ِsَّnُkْlٱ", "root": "كنس"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 17, "text": "وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا عَسْعَسَ ", "translation": "And by the night as it closes in[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلَّيْلِ", "translit": "ِlْyَّlٱَw", "root": "ليل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَسْعَسَ", "translit": "َsَʿعْsَʿع", "root": "عسعس"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 18, "text": "وَٱلصُّبْحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ ", "translation": "And by the dawn when it breathes [i.e., stirs]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلصُّبْحِ", "translit": "ِḥْbُّṣlٱَw", "root": "صبح"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَنَفَّسَ", "translit": "َsَّfَnَt", "root": "نفس"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 19, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍ كَرِيمٍ ", "translation": "[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger [i.e., Gabriel]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَقَوْلُ", "translit": "ُlْwَqَl", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٍ", "translit": "ٍlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَرِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِrَk", "root": "كرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 20, "text": "ذِى قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِى ٱلْعَرْشِ مَكِينٍ ", "translation": "[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position],", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ذِى", "translit": "àِhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قُوَّةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَّwُq", "root": "قوي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عِندَ", "translit": "َdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ذِى", "translit": "àِhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْعَرْشِ", "translit": "ِhsْrَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عرش"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَكِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِkَm", "root": "مكن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 21, "text": "مُّطَاعٍ ثَمَّ أَمِينٍ ", "translation": "Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مُّطَاعٍ", "translit": "ٍʿعāَṭُّm", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ثَمَّ", "translit": "َّmَht", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَمِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 22, "text": "وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجْنُونٍ ", "translation": "And your companion [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ) ] is not [at all] mad.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "صَاحِبُكُم", "translit": "mُkُbِḥāَṣ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِمَجْنُونٍ", "translit": "ٍnwُnْjgَmِb", "root": "جنن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 23, "text": "وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ بِٱلْأُفُقِ ٱلْمُبِينِ ", "translation": "And he has already seen him [i.e., Gabriel] in the clear horizon.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَءَاهُ", "translit": "ُhāَءَr", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِٱلْأُفُقِ", "translit": "ِqُfُaʾْlٱِb", "root": "افق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُبِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِbُmْlٱ", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 24, "text": "وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلْغَيْبِ بِضَنِينٍ ", "translation": "And he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْغَيْبِ", "translit": "ِbْyَغْlٱ", "root": "غيب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِضَنِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِnَḍِb", "root": "ضنن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 25, "text": "وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَيْطَٰنٍ رَّجِيمٍ ", "translation": "And it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِقَوْلِ", "translit": "ِlْwَqِb", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "شَيْطَٰنٍ", "translit": "ٍnَٰṭْyَhs", "root": "شطن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَّجِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِjgَّr", "root": "رجم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 26, "text": "فَأَيْنَ تَذْهَبُونَ ", "translation": "So where are you going?[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَذْهَبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbَhْhdَt", "root": "ذهب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 27, "text": "إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "It is not except a reminder to the worlds", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ذِكْرٌ", "translit": "ٌrْkِhd", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlِّl", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 28, "text": "لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمْ أَن يَسْتَقِيمَ ", "translation": "For whoever wills among you to take a right course.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لِمَن", "translit": "nَmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "شَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَسْتَقِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِqَtْsَy", "root": "قوم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 29, "text": "وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And you do not will except that Allāh wills - Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَشَآءُونَ", "translit": "َnwُءٓāَhsَt", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَشَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "رَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}], "tafsir": {"12": [{"arabic": "وفي سورة التكوير أهوال يوم القيامة وانكشاف الخاتمة وهو قوله تعالى: ﴿ وإذا الجحيم سعرت وإذا الجنة أزلفت علمت نفس ما أحضرت ﴾ {} وفي عم يتساءلون ﴿ يوم ينظر المرء ما قدمت يداه ﴾ {} الآية، وقوله تعالى: ﴿ لا يتكلمون إلا من أذن له الرحمن وقال صوابا ﴾ {} والقرآن من أوله إلى آخره مخاوف لمن قرأه بتدبر", "english": "And in Surah At-Takwir (The Folding Up), the terrors of the Day of Resurrection and the unveiling of the final outcome, and that is His saying, the Exalted: 'And when the Hellfire (Al-Jahim) is kindled (su'irat), and when Paradise is brought near, a soul (Nafs) will know what it has prepared.' And in 'Amma Yatasa'alun (Surah An-Naba'), 'The Day when a person will see what his hands have sent forth' - the verse, and His saying, the Exalted: 'They will not speak except whom the Most Merciful (Ar-Rahman) has permitted and says what is correct.' And the Quran from its beginning to its end is fears for whoever reads it with contemplation.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book3.doc.txt", "book_title": "Fear and Hope", "content_type": "afterlife", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on death, the grave, and preparation for the Hereafter, from 'Fear and Hope'", "badge": "Afterlife"}], "15": [{"arabic": "ثم انظر كيف عظم الله أمر السموات والنجوم فى كتابه فما من سورة إلا وتشتمل على تفخيمها فى مواضع وكم من قسم فى القرآن بها كقوله تعالى والسماء ذات البروج والسماء والطارق والسماء ذات الحبك والسماء وما بناها وكقوله تعالى والشمس وضحاها والقمر إذا تلاها وكقوله تعالى فلا أقسم بالخنس الجوار الكنس وقوله تعالى والنجم إذا هوى فلا أقسم بمواقع النجوم وإنه لقسم لو تعلمون عظيم فقد علمت أن عجائب النطفة القذرة عجز عن معرفتها الأولون والآخرون وما أقسم الله بها فما ظنك بما اقسم الله تعالى به وأحال الأرزاق عليه وأضاف", "english": "Then look at how Allah has magnified the matter of the heavens and the stars in His Book, for there is no surah except that it contains their glorification in places, and how many oaths in the Quran are by them, such as His saying, the Exalted: 'And by the heaven with its constellations' (85:1), and 'And by the heaven and the night-comer' (86:1), and 'And by the heaven with its paths' (51:7), and 'And by the heaven and He who built it' (91:5), and His saying, the Exalted: 'By the sun and its brightness' (91:1), and 'And by the moon when it follows it' (91:2), and His saying, the Exalted: 'So I swear by the receding ones (al-Khunnas), the moving ones (al-Jawār), the hiding ones (al-Kunnas)' (81:15-16), and His saying: 'And by the star when it sets' (53:1), 'So I swear by the positions of the stars' (56:75), 'And indeed, it is an oath, if you only knew, great' (56:76). You have known that the wonders of the filthy drop (an-Nutfa) have baffled the knowledge of the former and the latter, and Allah did not swear by it, so what do you think of that by which Allah, the Exalted, has sworn and referred the provisions (al-Arzāq) to it and attributed them to it, saying, the Exalted: 'And in the heaven is your provision (Rizq) and what you are promised' (51:22), and He praised those who contemplate (al-Mufakkirīn) in it, saying: 'And they contemplate (Yatafakkarūn) in the creation of the heavens and the earth' (3:191).", "book_file": "vol4_j4-k09.doc.txt", "book_title": "Contemplation", "content_type": "dhikr", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the virtue and practice of remembering God, from 'Contemplation'", "badge": "Dhikr"}], "29": [{"arabic": "إذن الأمر أمر الله والقضاء قضاؤه وعصمه الله من كل ما تخوفت عليه من أمر الدنيا والدين", "english": "Then the matter is Allah's matter and the decree is His decree, and Allah protected him from everything I feared for him regarding worldly and religious affairs.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book10.doc.txt", "book_title": "Book of Repentance", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Book of Repentance'", "badge": "Ethics"}]}, "wordTiming": {"abdulbasit": {"1": [[1, 250, 1018], [2, 1018, 2101], [3, 2101, 3208]], "2": [[1, 350, 1613], [2, 1613, 3308], [3, 3308, 4547]], "3": [[1, 250, 1230], [2, 1230, 2300], [3, 2300, 3339]